/*--------------------------------*- Choupo -*--------------------------------*\
  POST-FLAME NOx MECHANISM = the O Conaire 2004 H2/O2 core (21 entries,
  Table I -- set OConaire2004 of the kinetics library) + the Glarborg 2018
  nitrogen chemistry (Prog. Energy Combust. Sci. 67, 31, DOI
  10.1016/j.pecs.2018.01.002; set Glarborg2018): extended Zeldovich
  (their Table 2: N+NO, N+OH, N+O2 -- thermal NO forms through the REVERSE of
  Z1, O + N2 -> NO + N, Ea ~ 75 kcal via the equilibrium constant) and the N2O
  route (R15-R19, incl. the N2O(+M) Lindemann falloff).  All A/b/Ea in
  mol-cm-s-cal as the sources print them; the engine converts and announces.
  Reverse rates from equilibrium, through the thermo of the 13 species (the
  flame-range heat capacities are NASA-9 polynomials read from
  NASA/TP-2002-211556).

  READ FROM THE KINETICS LIBRARY (DEV.md 4c C458 slice 1): two sets, one file
  per reaction in data/standards/kinetics/; until 2026-11-22 the 29 entries
  were written out here.  The Glarborg records say `page unrecorded`: nobody
  in this tree has read the paper's page.

  THE NNH ROUTE (Glarborg 2018 R20-R24) IS NOT CARRIED, since 2026-10-25
  (DEV.md 4c C164): its thermo had come from a mechanism's thermo file that
  grants no redistribution, and no public-domain primary for NNH's heat
  capacity and entropy was found (NASA/TP-2002-211556 has no NNH entry).
  An ABSENCE, named: the route matters in the flame front, far less in the
  post-flame gas this case holds, and the plateau still lands on the Gibbs
  ceiling (README).
\*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

